{"root":"tetap","ipa":"/tətap/","core":"表示状态的持续、不变或坚持，意为“仍然”、“保持”、“固定”。","pos":["形容词","虚词"],"scenes":["高频","工作","生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/tətap/","zh":"仍然；保持；固定；不变。","phrases":[{"t":"tetap tinggal","zh":"仍然居住"},{"t":"harga tetap","zh":"固定价格"},{"t":"tetap semangat","zh":"保持精神/斗志"}],"examples":[{"t":"Dia tetap bekerja meskipun sudah lelah.","zh":"尽管已经累了，他仍然在工作。"},{"t":"Keputusan itu sudah tetap.","zh":"那个决定已经是固定的了。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"tetap","ipa":"/tətap/","zh":"仍然；固定。","phrase":{"t":"tetap pendirian","zh":"立场坚定"},"example":{"t":"Cuaca tetap panas hari ini.","zh":"今天天气依然炎热。"}},{"w":"menetap","ipa":"/mənətap/","zh":"定居；居住。","phrase":{"t":"menetap di luar negeri","zh":"定居国外"},"example":{"t":"Mereka memutuskan untuk menetap di Jakarta.","zh":"他们决定在雅加达定居。"}},{"w":"menetapkan","ipa":"/mənətapkan/","zh":"确定；规定；设定。","phrase":{"t":"menetapkan aturan","zh":"制定规则"},"example":{"t":"Pemerintah menetapkan hari libur nasional.","zh":"政府规定了全国假日。"}},{"w":"penetapan","ipa":"/pənətapan/","zh":"确定；设定；任命。","phrase":{"t":"penetapan harga","zh":"定价"},"example":{"t":"Penetapan jadwal rapat dilakukan besok.","zh":"会议日程的确定将在明天进行。"}},{"w":"ketetapan","ipa":"/kətətapan/","zh":"决定；规定；稳定性。","phrase":{"t":"ketetapan hati","zh":"决心"},"example":{"t":"Ketetapan itu harus dipatuhi oleh semua anggota.","zh":"所有成员必须遵守该规定。"}}],"derSlugs":["tetap","menetap","menetapkan","penetapan","ketetapan"],"model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-25T09:25:31.796Z","src":"base"}